nce platform.</p><h2>How to choose</h2><p>Ask what is missing today. Governance system of record: a care compliance platform. Template flexibility: a general inspection app. Thin evidence because nobody opens the app on the floor: a no-app WhatsApp workflow. These are not mutually exclusive.</p><h2>Pricing</h2><p>Quickler pricing is only for active users: [[price:bundles]]. An active user completed at least two workflows that month, and dormant users are free.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What is the best care home audit software in the UK?</h3><p>There is no single best. Match the tool to the need: a care governance platform for a system of record, a general inspection app for template flexibility, or quickler for lightweight no-app capture.</p><h3>How does quickler compare to Radar Healthcare or Access Care Compliance?</h3><p>They are care governance and compliance platforms that typically do more than audits alone, and more than quickler in governance and risk. Check their current offering. Quickler is the no-app audit capture layer and can sit alongside a governance platform.</p><h3>Is quickler a care records or eMAR system?</h3><p>No. Quickler is an audit and evidence tool, not a care records, eMAR, clinical or full care governance system.</p>",
